  "content": "\n\n<p>此模組為「Tom's Simple Storage Terminals」與「Create」之間新增相容性。本模組需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom's Simple Storage</a>。或使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create Fabric</a> 搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/toms-storage-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tom's Simple Storage Fabric</a>。</p>\n<p>允許透過 Tom's Simple Storage 的終端機來存取整個已組裝組合機械的物品欄。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/911/265/2024-07-08_01.png\" alt=\"列車上的終端機\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/912/258/2024-07-09_19.png\" alt=\"沉思的終端機\"><br>安裝模組後，現有搭載終端機的組合機械必須重新組裝。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
